gories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"XTssUDUwofqaVzaJ6fG_-Q","review_id":"cLetJn0dILQpwNv3vQ7wlw","date":"2019-04-22T14:26:17","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9412988424301147,"text_excerpt":"I had been wanting to try this place after a friend recommended it for coffee. I finally stopped in last week and I got an Iced Latte. It was excellent. (To me it appears to basically be a place for coffee, but apparently you can order from a small menu of breakfast/lunch, too.) They also have a bakery case with pastries and desserts. They are one of the few places around here that offers Oat Milk, too (for an upcharge). I did not get that, but good to know they offer it. They also offer a frequent buyer punch card. Unfortunately, the day I went they were all out of cards. So, that was disappointing. There is some seating inside as well as tables outside. Good place overall, though."},{"business_id":"XTssUDUwofqaVzaJ6fG_-Q","review_id":"xOIWgdImgGEA4oFyeonXZQ","date":"2019-04-25T16:30:56","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9365601539611816,"text_excerpt":"(Freakin' Siri- Don't trust her when trying to get to Revelator in mid-city because that robot will send you towards a back alley of American Can and tell you you've arrived. Just get to Orleans Avenue and you'll be saved the 20 minute chaos I went through.) Now onto the review itself! I'm a big fan of Revelator out on Tchoup so when I heard they had a new location in town I was more than happy to go check it out and support it. This is a mixed development area with businesses and apartments which is becoming more and more of a norm around the country which I love. The space is screaming with natural light and the clean lines and muted colors makes it very easy to focus on work or to get ..."},{"business_id":"XTssUDUwofqaVzaJ6fG_-Q","review_id":"FSIg3uXnFDfXkDK7847YAg","date":"2019-03-11T22:33:37","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9352688789367676,"text_excerpt":"Finally something has moved into this space at the American Can! It has sat empty for years and I'm so happy that this little cafe has moved in. This spot just opened, and I wanted to check it out, so I stopped in for a quick lunch on a slow afternoon. It's primarily a coffee shop that also serves some breakfast and lunch style bites and I decided to get the empanada and the chorizo egg biscuit. I also got an iced green tea. You order at the counter and everything comes out ready to be taken out, but you can get some plates and utensils if you let them know that you're eating in. Empanda- this was a great start. The crust was nice and flaky and the meat inside was tender. It also came wit..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"XTssUDUwofqaVzaJ6fG_-Q","photo_id":"4GJDlmNL4bM5NOMoyWqWpA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/4GJDlmNL4bM5NOMoyWqWpA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8911805748939514},{"business_id":"XTssUDUwofqaVzaJ6fG_-Q","photo_id":"XKKo2Z-ZhhlbMMwlGjuSLA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/XKKo2Z-ZhhlbMMwlGjuSLA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8508970737457275},{"business_id":"XTssUDUwofqaVzaJ6fG_-Q","photo_id":"LmmyaRXlesBq5aJQ9BZ40g","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/LmmyaRXlesBq5aJQ9BZ40g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.839185357093811},{"business_id":"XTssUDUwofqaVzaJ6fG_-Q","photo_id":"zzDXFQS_i6jLW_OcgnSLfg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/